---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy — Roomly">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Updated 21 September 2026</p>
    <h1>Privacy, in plain language.</h1>
  </header>
  <article class="prose">
    <h2>Visiting this website</h2>
    <p>
      These pages do not install advertising cookies or include analytics
      scripts. Our hosting provider processes technical request information
      needed to deliver and protect the website. Images are served with the
      site.
    </p>
    <h2>Getting in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Contact links open your email application. If you email us, we receive the
      contact information and message you choose to send and use them to respond
      to your enquiry. Avoid sending identity documents or sensitive tenancy
      information by email.
    </p>
    <h2>Using the application</h2>
    <p>
      Roomly accounts use authentication and session cookies. An organisation’s
      workspace can contain contact details, tenancy and payment records,
      documents and property photographs entered by its authorised users. Access
      depends on organisation membership and role.
    </p>
    <h2>Records and retention</h2>
    <p>
      The organisation operating a workspace decides which records to collect
      and configures its retention arrangements. Contact that organisation about
      access, corrections, deletion or how your information is used. Documents
      use private storage with expiring access links.
    </p>
    <h2>Providers and questions</h2>
    <p>
      The application uses Supabase for authentication, database and file
      storage, and Vercel for hosting. Optional email delivery depends on the
      organisation’s configuration. Questions about this website can be sent to{" "}
      <a href="mailto:joshuakhalili20@gmail.com">joshuakhalili20@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
